{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-ring-home", "R-pinky-top", "R-middle-top"],
  "note": "T1: keys {k1=L-pinky-top,k2=L-ring-home,k3=L-index-bottom-in,k4=R-pinky-top} hold {A,D,I,X} bijectively (unknown perm). Rot after T1: G1={L-index-top-in,L-ring-bottom,R-index-home} permuted among itself. T2 presses {k1,k2,k4,k5=R-middle-top}. After S2(sorted4)=set S: omitted letter from {A,D,I,X}\\S = k3. The other 3 letters from {A,D,I,X} in S correspond to {k1,k2,k4}. Record any rotation group(s) from T2 as new permutation constraints."
}

