  "note": "T3: K1=L-pinky-top,K2=L-ring-home,K4=R-pinky-top,K5=R-middle-top held {A,I,V,X}; since K1/K2/K4 ∈ {A,D,I,X} => K5=V and {K1,K2,K4}={A,I,X}. After T3 rotate {L-middle-bottom, L-middle-top, K2} (derangement among those 3). Plan T4 chord {K1,K4,K3=L-index-bottom-in,K5} to identify letters on K1,K4 and check K3."
}

{
