    "R-middle-top": "V"
  },
  "note": "T5: press K1=L-pinky-top (NOT K4=R-pinky-top) + R-middle-top (known V) + {L-middle-home,R-index-top} (from last rotation). Since A/I at time T4 were on {K1,K4} and K4 excluded, observed set in T5 will contain exactly one of {A,I} -> that one = symbol on L-pinky-top. Use rotation notice among any rotated keys to update for T6."
}

