  "note": "T9 got {A,U,V,W} from [L-pinky-top,R-middle-top,R-index-top,R-pinky-top]; so R-index-top∈{U,W}, R-pinky-top∈{U,W} (pre-rotation). Rotation after T9: {L-index-bottom-in,R-pinky-top} rotated => L-index-bottom-in gets R-pinky-top(from T9) later. From T7: [L-pinky-top,R-middle-top,R-index-top,L-ring-home]->{A,O,U,V} so R-index-top∈{O,U}. Assume consistent => R-index-top=U; locking it this turn. If returned set after T10 has remaining {U,O} then L-ring-home=O."
